  <text>
    <body>
      <p><seg source="#source-595-613">垣間見ぬ君が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-613-637"><rb>室内</rb><rt>へやぬち</rt></ruby></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-639-657"><rb>明日</rb><rt>あす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-657-689">来むと云いし其の日に</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-689-718">待てど君姿は見ゑず</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-718-724">我心</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-724-751"><rb>苛苛</rb><rt>いらいら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-751-762">しさに</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-762-786">垣間見ぬ君が室内</seg></p>
    </body>
